# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
tfplan
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars.local
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Chaves privadas geradas pelo Terraform (ex.: tls_private_key + local_sensitive_file)
*.pem

# Zips de deploy de Lambda gerados via data "archive_file" (build artifact)
*.zip

# manter o lock file versionado
!.terraform.lock.hcl
